      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "BAY OF FIRES (11) showed good promise in finishing top-two in all four outings of the maiden campaign, winning twice. Has not raced for 11 weeks but looks forward enough for the return after a minor placing in a recent trial. May need a bit of luck from this difficult draw but expecting a bright start to the campaign. SET PLAY (7) made it two wins at this circuit and distance from the last four outings when he worked from a similar barrier but was too strong at his latest appearance, scoring by a head. Likely to be there at the finish again. HESOURCELEBRITY (6) made it back-to-back placings at this circuit and distance when he got within a head of SET PLAY last week. Draws lower so could break through. A back row draw makes the task of MY ULTIMATE FRANCO NZ (10) a bit tougher but he has been ticking along well, beaten less than 2m into third from a wider barrier here last time.",
